	(text_box "Main MCU\n\nconnected to esp32 and FPGA\n\n\nShould have:\n- own regulator 5V\n- out pins GPIO and ADC convertor\n- external FLASH\n- working LED\n- diagnostic LED (NEOPIXEL)\n- Buzzer?\n\n\n\nFor referance used the recomended design by Raspbery itself\nhttps://pip-assets.raspberrypi.com/categories/1214-rp2350/documents/RP-008280-DS-1-hardware-design-with-rp2350.pdf"
